== What is Freebuff? ==
Freebuff is not a search engine and not a chat box that only writes text back. The work is a loop: '''request → context → decision → tool call → result → next step'''.

Four layers are easy to collapse into one word:
{| class="wikitable"
! Layer !! What it decides
|-
| Model || Generates the reply and chooses the next action
|-
| Agent || Gives the model a role, instructions, project context and tools
|-
| Tool || Performs one concrete action: read a file, search text, run a command
|-
| Runtime || Where that action happens — your machine or a cloud workspace
|}

Freebuff is made by the Codebuff team on top of [https://codebuff.com Codebuff], an open multi-agent framework, and is often described as the free alternative to Claude Code, Codex CLI, Cursor, Windsurf and Devin. The source is public ([https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff CodebuffAI/freebuff], Apache-2.0), and Freebuff reads <code>AGENTS.md</code> and <code>CLAUDE.md</code> so project rules you already wrote still apply.

